                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "TweetDeck Web App",
                "text": "If the current ACA tax credits are allowed to expire at the end of this year, thousands of families will see their healthcare costs go up considerably or could lose healthcare altogether. At a time when families are feeling the squeeze from increased costs throughout the economy, we must act to extend these credits as Congress works to fund the government.",
