                "text": "Without action by Donald Trump and Congress, many of the ACA tax credits that help lower the cost of premiums will expire soon. I\u2019m fighting in Congress to extend these critical tax credits and lower your healthcare costs. As families continue to feel the squeeze, I will not support legislation that makes healthcare and other services more expensive.\n\nhttps://t.co/7ajBcbaR9R",
