                "text": "If we don\u2019t extend the ACA tax credits, thousands of New York families will see their premiums increase by an average of $3,000. Costs are high not just for healthcare but also for everyday goods and services. It will be unacceptable to let these tax credits expire. https://t.co/KNTFxW6G1m",
