                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The most unprofessional Presidential Administration in history\u2014led by a number of highly unqualified Secretaries of HHS, Defense, Education, and other agencies\u2014now wants to tell us which categories in healthcare professions no longer deserve \u201cprofessional\u201d degree classification and higher education funding\u2014nursing, physical therapy, audiology, social work, and others. This is simply the implementation of an anti-education agenda, downgrading professions that provide needed services to Americans. What we really need is to be encouraging more Americans to enter these professions instead of putting up more barriers to entry.",
